Skills in a preset are usually symlinks into a canonical definition elsewhere in the
same marketplace, created like this:

  ln -s ../../../../agent-plugins/plugins/conventions/skills/commit-messages .

A symlink resolving elsewhere in the same marketplace is dereferenced at install and the
target content is copied in place, so the bundle ships a real self-contained skill
without this repository duplicating anything.

Three resolution cases:
  inside the plugin's own directory  -> preserved as a relative symlink
  elsewhere in the same marketplace  -> dereferenced and copied
  outside the marketplace            -> skipped for security

Original content that belongs only to this preset lives here as a normal directory.
